 * No WireMock stubs: detect-external-calls found zero HTTP-based external calls reachable from
 * addComment (.nimbus/artifacts/detect-external-calls/CommunityController_addComment.json).
 * addComment publishes a comment.created Kafka event, which is fire-and-forget and non-HTTP
 * (out of WireMock's scope per pipeline Core Principle #4).
 *
 * Checklist cross-reference (.nimbus/artifacts/test-plan/CommunityService_addComment.md):
 *  - NTC_branch_addComment_2 (Happy Path) -> covered by NTC_* methods below.
 *  - ATC_postId_noData (DB WHERE postId, no matching row) -> ATC_postId_notFound below.
